sw1>show hostname
Hostname: sw1
sw1>show interfaces nope
% Interface not found: nope
sw1>show ip interface brief | include Interface
Interface      IP Address             Status     Protocol   MTU
sw1>show interfaces status | include Port
Port           Status       MTU
sw1>show version | include Hostname
Hostname:         sw1
sw1>show version | include Architecture | count
Number of lines in output: 1
sw1>show ip
% Incomplete command
sw1>show ip route | include Codes
Codes: C - connected, S - static (via gateway)
sw1>show ipv6 route | include Codes
Codes: C - connected, S - static (via gateway)
sw1>show arp | include Address
Address            Hardware Addr    Interface
sw1>show processes | include PID | count
Number of lines in output: 1
sw1>show ip route nonsense
% Invalid address 'nonsense'
sw1>show ip route 999.1.1.1
% Invalid address '999.1.1.1'
sw1>show ipv6 route 1.2.3.4
% Invalid address '1.2.3.4'
sw1>quit
